  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Magic action, you can expend one use of your Channel Divinity to present your Holy Symbol and castigate unworldly beings. Each Aberration, Celestial, Elemental, Fey, or Fiend within 30 feet of you that can hear you must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failure, it is turned for 1 minute or until it takes damage. A turned creature must spend its turns trying to move as far from you as it can, and it can't willingly end its move within 30 feet of you. For its action, it can only Dash or try to escape an effect that prevents it from moving; if there's nowhere to move, it can take the Dodge action.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
